[{"title":"敦仁坐舟中避嫌不肯再顾诗以要之","author":"苏葵","text":"心严不惮门如市，舟寂惟应日似年。\n莫道我无江阁马，侯门真有鹤蹁跹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54570,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登庸次弟为宪副吴怀德赋泮水采芹","author":"苏葵","text":"长申直欲摛星斗，吐豪可以吞江山。\n短檠分得青藜火，夜照宫墙数仞间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54571,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月宫扳桂","author":"苏葵","text":"姮娥爱君英妙时，桂花先与最香枝。\n银蟾侧畔经行处，曾笑吴刚下斧迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54572,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枫宸献策","author":"苏葵","text":"晨捧纶音玉版香，敢为曲学媚君王。\n萧墙得失千年鉴，却比刘蕡说更详。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54573,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉陛趋朝","author":"苏葵","text":"天仗传呼出紫宸，危楼侧畔听鸡人。\n班前不是轻翘首，毫发龙颜认要真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54574,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南郊陪祀","author":"苏葵","text":"苍璧元璜对越馀，彩云灿灿护銮舆。\n精诚自不勤天语，谁识公当第七车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54575,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葡萄酒","author":"苏葵","text":"袅袅龙须百尺苍，露花清沁水晶香。\n等闲不博凉州牧，