飞抹晚霞，锦江艳艳木莲花。\n牙筹数尽分秋兴，半付诗家半酒家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54616,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日汉州行台夜坐二首 其一","author":"苏葵","text":"寒虫唧唧树萧萧，无奈羁怀纵酒瓢。\n坐到二更三点彻，忽然疏雨入芭蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54617,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日汉州行台夜坐二首 其二","author":"苏葵","text":"不独风寒月亦寒，无风良月上栏杆。\n十年留得青毡在，坐展西铭剪烛看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54618,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫书","author":"苏葵","text":"汉阴抱瓮岂知劳，自后人间尽桔槔。\n欲话此心谁复许，杖藜吟笑过江皋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54619,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道上观山","author":"苏葵","text":"近山苍翠远山微，似有如无更觉奇。\n几日胸中有全画，丹青从此不须披。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54620,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道逢耕叟","author":"苏葵","text":"犁困黄牛嚼草芽，溪流低护石田斜。\n农人两两事鸡卜，卜得汗邪定满车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54621,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜客中独坐对月","author":"苏葵","text":"满院清光夜未分，离人对此易消魂。\n冰轮却在巴山上，也照梅花岭外村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54622,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘都宪登庸次第卷十首 其一 泮水春融","author":"苏葵","text":"绿芹香霭杏芳菲，童冠知谁是浴沂。\n看罢六经芸阁暖，此心元并古人驰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54623,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘都宪登庸次第卷十首 其二 广寒秋色","author":"苏葵","text":"金粟花开袭殿香，无人曾识折花郎。\n银桥玉宇浑窥遍，惊得姮娥彻晓忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54624,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘都宪登庸次第卷十首 其三 黄甲题名","author":"苏葵","text":"芳名速似置邮驰，甲第峥嵘淡墨馡。\n卤簿森然胪唱罢，玉阶香雾正霏霏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54625,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘都宪登庸次第卷十首 其四 郎官应宿","author":"苏葵","text":"天上星辰地上官，铜章休作割鸡看。\n须知太史循良传，便与乾坤永不刊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54626,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘都宪登庸次第卷十首 其五 青春衣绣","author":"苏葵","text":"英豪得意在芳年，绣豸轻罗草色鲜。\n忽日偶乘骢马过，六街人指似神仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54627,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘都宪登庸次第卷十首 其六 白简朝天","author":"苏葵","text":"白简昂昂侍里行，朝阳红映豸衣明。\n袖中谏疏知多少，汉主徒惊白马生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54628,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘都宪登庸次第卷十首 其七 金门待漏","author":"苏葵","text":"衣乌星彩五更明，人傍金门听漏声。\n立马据鞍思谏草，豸衣沾得露华清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54629,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘都宪登庸次第卷十首 其八 宪府详刑","author":"苏葵","text":"曾参两造解冤围，笑杀秦人有赭衣。\n白日青天无点翳，柏台不是释之谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54630,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘都宪登庸次第卷十首 其九 两淮揽辔","author":"苏葵","text":"淮水苍苍淮月光，行经斥卤尽飞霜。\n如今志在澄清者，回首东都失范滂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54631,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘都宪登庸次第卷十首 其十 六诏乘骢","author":"苏葵","text":"昆明池外万山苍，骢马南来斧钺刚。\n十数州城人尽说，绝无行路跳豺狼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54632,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋望月","author":"苏葵","text":"乱云如墨翳中天，宝镜空矜此夕圆。\n巽二有知能净扫，万方何处不婵娟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54633,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋风","author":"苏葵","text":"秋风不高鹏不飞，尚垂双翅滞天池。\n凭谁蚤揭南箕簸，莫误扶摇九万期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54634,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栽花","author":"苏葵","text":"凿石轩东结小坛，蔷薇芟尽种芝兰。\n幽香满院无荆棘，不怕西风一夜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54635,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏遣怀六首 其一","author":"苏葵","text":"侯门衒智平生短，闹市安禅亦未能。\n解向乾坤寻乐事，两肩攒处却何曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54636,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏遣怀六首 其二","author":"苏葵","text":"阶前惯见蘼芜长，枥下时闻骏马鸣。\n懒向人前谈得失，机关消尽是揪枰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54637,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏遣怀六首 其三","author":"苏葵","text":"到耳清声蕉叶雨，入怀香气芰荷风。\n倚栏一曲心如水，意趣人间几个同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54638,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏遣怀六首 其四","author":"苏葵","text":"怀中明月何曾暗，意里阳春不□寒。\n三十六宫天地迥，自家来往自家看。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":54639,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]